  "body": "### Summary\n\nCapture the home page (`/`) as answered to a logged-in session whose cookies have expired: is it the logged-out home or a `.hop` page?\n\n### Scope\n\nRead-only GET on the Mac with the LOT-001 kit; anonymize; add the MANIFEST row and a legacy oracle if a parser reads it.\n\n### Wanted by\n\nLOT-047 (#73, merged in #35): until captured, the MP unread poll returns nil (no information) in both cases; also informs LOT-044 (#70) expiry detection.\n\n### Source\n\nRow added to the docs/LOTS.md Capture backlog by #35 after the issue migration.\n",
