   "body": "### Capture result\nCorpus: `R70a` (stale session), with `R72b` (logged in) for contrast; PR #386 (`capture/session-expiry`).\nA jar with the account's `md_user`/`md_id` and a `md_passs` HFR refuses gets **200, a 1574-byte `.hop` \"Identifiants invalides !\" with `Refresh: 1; url=/unlog.php?config=hfr.inc`**, no `cat=prive` row, no `Set-Cookie`. It is neither the logged-out home nor a redirect.\nChanges: LOT-047 (poll still reads it as `nil`), LOT-044, LOT-092 (#184). Classification work: #383.",
